sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Student
    participant APP as Android app (Act.tsx)
    participant API as FastAPI POST /actions (main.py)
    participant V as verify.py
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant S as scoring.py
    U->>APP: choose action type, tap "Take photo & submit"
    APP->>APP: Camera.getPhoto (camera only), Geolocation.getCurrentPosition
    APP->>API: multipart: user_id, action_type, lat, lon, client_time, photo (+ before_photo for cleanup)
    API->>V: compute_phash(photo)
    API->>DB: SELECT phash FROM actions
    DB-->>API: stored hashes
    API->>V: check_clock, check_geofence, check_duplicate
    alt any check failed
        V-->>API: failure reasons
        Note over API: status = rejected, AI not run
    else all checks passed
        API->>V: detect (YOLOv8n) on photo (and before photo)
        V-->>API: detections
        API->>V: ai_check, then decide(confidence, 0.60, 0.30)
        V-->>API: approved / needs_review / rejected + reason
    end
    API->>API: save photo(s) to uploads/ (UUID .jpg)
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO actions
    opt status is approved
        API->>S: apply_approval
        S->>DB: set points, create or close hotspot
    end
    API-->>APP: JSON: id, status, confidence, points, reasons, detections
    APP-->>U: result screen
